text":"Then she gave birth to another son and named him Shelah; it was at Chezib that she gave birth to him.","from":21},{"book":"GEN","chapter":46,"verse":12,"verseEnd":12,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"The sons of Judah: Er, Onan, Shelah, Perez, and Zerah; but Er and Onan died in the land of Canaan. The sons of Perez: Hezron and Hamul.","from":21},{"book":"GEN","chapter":46,"verse":17,"verseEnd":17,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"The children of Asher: Imnah, Ishvah, Ishvi, Beriah, and their sister Serah. The sons of Beriah: Heber and Malchiel.","from":18},{"book":"NUM","chapter":13,"verse":6,"verseEnd":6,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"from the tribe of Judah, Caleb son of Jephunneh;","from":15},{"book":"NUM","chapter":13,"verse":30,"verseEnd":30,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Then Caleb quieted the people before Moses and said, “We must go up and take possession of the land, for we can certainly conquer it!”","from":15},{"book":"NUM","chapter":14,"verse":6,"verseEnd":10,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Joshua son of Nun and Caleb son of Jephunneh, who were among those who had spied out the land, tore their clothes and said to the whole congregation of Israel, “The land we passed through and explored is an exceedingly good land. If the LORD delights in us, He will bring us into this land, a land flowing with milk and honey, and He will give it to us. Only do not rebel against the LORD, and do not be afraid of the people of the land, for they will be like bread for us. Their protection has been removed, and the LORD is with us. Do not be afraid of them!” But the whole congregation threatened to stone Joshua and Caleb. Then the glory of the LORD appeared to all the Israelites at the Tent of Meeting.","from":15},{"book":"NUM","chapter":14,"verse":24,"verseEnd":24,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"But because My servant Caleb has a different spirit and has followed Me wholeheartedly, I will bring him into the land he has entered, and his descendants will inherit it.","from":15},{"book":"NUM","chapter":14,"verse":30,"verseEnd":30,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Surely none of you will enter the land in which I swore to settle you, except Caleb son of Jephunneh and Joshua son of Nun.","from":15}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"judges-era","title":"Judges era and the road to David","people":2}]},"24-33":{"people":[{"id":"jachin-h3199g","name":"Jachin","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Simeon","count":1,"firstVerse":24},{"id":"jamin-h3226g","name":"Jamin","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Simeon","count":1,"firstVerse":24},{"id":"jemuel-h3223","name":"Jemuel","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Simeon","count":1,"firstVerse":24},{"id":"shaul-h7586h","name":"Shaul","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Simeon","count":1,"firstVerse":24},{"id":"simeon-h8095g","name":"Simeon","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":1,"firstVerse":24},{"id":"zerah-h2226l","name":"Zerah","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Simeon","count":1,"firstVerse":24},{"id":"mishma-h4927h","name":"Mishma","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Mibsam","count":2,"firstVerse":25},{"id":"mibsam-h4017h","name":"Mibsam","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Shallum","count":1,"firstVerse":25},{"id":"shallum-h7967k","name":"Shallum","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Shaul","count":1,"firstVerse":25},{"id":"shimei-h8096k","name":"Shimei","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Zaccur","count":2,"firstVerse":26},{"id":"hammuel-h2536","name":"Hammuel","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Mishma","count":1,"firstVerse":26},{"id":"zaccur-h2139h","name":"Zaccur","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Hammuel","count":1,"firstVerse":26},{"id":"judah-h3063g","name":"Judah","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":1,"firstVerse":27},{"id":"david-h1732","name":"David","kind":"person","brief":"King of Judah","count":1,"firstVerse":31}],"places":[{"id":"beersheba-h0884","name":"Beersheba","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":28},{"id":"hazar-shual-h2705","name":"Hazar-shual","kind":"place","brief":"","co